    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Lying flat definitely sets it off. I'd give it a five, you know, out of ten. As for pounding heart, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. Okay, so I'd been sweating, but that went away.",
